TITLE:: Debouncer
summary:: A  function debouncer
categories:: Utilities
related:: jostMlib



DESCRIPTION::
A debouncer counter for functions. Has an option to fire immediately.



CLASSMETHODS::

METHOD:: new


ARGUMENT:: func
any function to be debounced

ARGUMENT:: wait
the debounce wait time

ARGUMENT:: immediate
whether to fire the first item immediately.

returns:: a Debouncer


INSTANCEMETHODS::

PRIVATE: init
(describe method here)

METHOD:: trigger
triggers the function, only once within the wait period

ARGUMENT::  ... args
any arguments that need to be  passed to the function.


METHOD:: reset
reset the debouncer, setting the counts to 0



EXAMPLES::

code::

// Test Debouncer
(
var db = Debouncer({ "Debouncer fired".postln; }, 0.5);
db.trigger;
db.trigger;
db.trigger;
// should fire once after 0.5s
)

(
var db = Debouncer({ "Debouncer immediate fired".postln; }, 0.5, immediate: true);

Routine({
    db.trigger;
    0.1.wait;
    db.trigger;
    0.1.wait;
    db.trigger;
    // should fire only once
}).play;
)

(
var db = Debouncer({ "Debouncer reset - should not fire".postln; }, 0.5);

db.trigger;
db.reset;
// should not fire
)
::
